OL,3,AJohn Swinney tells SNP conference
OL,4,A'Scotland is ready to be independent'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Swinney addresses delegates at the
OL,7,FSNP conference in Aberdeen and
OL,8,Fannounces new government pledges
OL,10,FTo cheers from delegates, he says that
OL,11,F"by the end of this parliament [May
OL,12,F2031], through franchising and
OL,13,Fregulation, the SNP will bring the bus
OL,14,Fnetwork back into public control"
OL,16,FSwinney also said legislation would be
OL,17,Fintroduced before next summer to make
OL,18,F"harassment and abuse based on misogyny
OL,19,Fa specific criminal offence"
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
