OL,3,AJohn Swinney tells SNP conference
OL,4,A'Scotland is ready to be independent'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, during a visit to Scotland
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham urged the
OL,8,FScottish government to work with him
OL,9,Fand Westminster to put "power back in
OL,10,Fthe hands" of regions
OL,12,FSwinney did not name the PM in his
OL,13,Fspeech, but said: "Some think we are
OL,14,Fjust like Manchester. Well, I'm afraid
OL,15,FI disagree - Scotland is no city, no
OL,16,Fregion. We are a nation. And soon we
OL,17,Fwill be an independent nation."
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
